Is NEET compulsory for MBBS?
</summary>

<p>
Yes. Admission to MBBS in India generally requires a valid NEET UG qualification as per the applicable regulations.
</p>

</details>


<details class="faq-item">

<summary>
Can I study MBBS abroad?
</summary>

<p>
Yes. Several countries offer internationally recognised MBBS programmes. Eligibility, admission requirements and regulations vary by country and university.
</p>

</details>


